<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech unit to modernise Mongolia plant.</title>
<headline>VA Tech unit to modernise Mongolia plant.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Energy, a unit of engineering group VA Technologie AG, said on Tuesday it had won a contract worth 287 million schillings to modernise a coal power plant in Mongolia.</p>
<p>In consortium with Japan's Nissho Iwai Corp Austrian Energy will convert four boilers of Mongolia's largest power plant TES 4 in the capital Ulan Bator.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 257</p>
</text>
